    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d588">

                <pb facs="1028" n="968" xml:id="pg968"/>

                <head>Mr. Pruyn to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 30.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Caracas,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-09-10"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 10, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor herewith to forward you
                    (see inclosure No. 1) a copy of a dispatch addressed by the minister of foreign
                    relations of this government to the consul general of the Netherlands, residing
                    here, in reference to the course of the authorities of the island of Curaçoa in
                    regard to Venezuelan affairs.</p>
                <p>In inclosure No. 2 may be found a translation of the same communication.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to remain, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ERASTUS C. PRUYN, <hi rendition="#italic">Commercial Agent in charge of
                            the Legation of the United States.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d588-a1.xml" xpointer="d588-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
